## SmartRx reuse (portable, not re-drawn)

When implementing or refactoring shell widgets, **copy/adapt existing SmartRx patient `core` sources** for:

- `AppButton` / `AppPressable`
- `CustomTextField` (one `.search` variant — no duplicate search field)
- `Toaster` above floating dock (`rootNavigatorKey`, bottom inset)
- `AppDecision.show` (no raw `showDialog` for standard confirms)
- `CustomBottomSheet` **shell** (drag handle, content sizing, root navigator from shell)

**Adapt only:** theme tokens, `l10n`, assets, Bnood routes/errors. **Do not** reimplement “similar” buttons, toasts, or fields.

### CustomBottomSheet — SmartRx vs Bnood

| SmartRx (Dog handoff) | Bnood |
|------------------------|--------|
| `.actions` / `.choices` layouts | Same patterns where applicable |
| **No** nested `Navigator` | **Bnood-only:** single sheet hosts **local** `Navigator` for inline-create subflows |

Rules: one sheet at a time; push/pop inner routes; cancel restores parent draft; save returns selected entity; Back pops inner route — never stack sheets/dialogs.

## Bnood-specific components (to implement / converge)

### AppCard

Reusable surface: child content, optional gradient/border/shadow, padding, tap via **`AppPressable`**. Corners: **`AppShape.superellipse`** via `RoundedSuperellipseBorder` (see `bnood-superellipse.mdc`). Prefer **semantic presets** (stat receive/spend/remain, list row, fee card) over a mega-constructor with dozens of parameters.

### AppAmount

- Input: **integer piastres** only.
- Roles: receive (green), spend (red), remaining (teal), neutral.
- Centralize locale grouping, decimals, currency label, LTR isolation / direction — **one widget**, not per-screen `Text` formatting.

### AppFallback

Empty or error: icon, title, description, optional CTA (add / retry). **`AppFallback.section`** for grouped empties inside plain **`AppCard`** (compact type; optional `leading` widget). Full-screen default unchanged. No stack traces or HTTP codes in UI.

### Icons

Owner will supply **SVG** assets. Do not invent final icon mappings or swap in unrelated repeated placeholders in production polish.

## Loading

No loading-state redesign in current UI phase unless owner asks.
